<template><section id="daily-food" class="daily-food" aria-labelledby="daily-food-title"><header class="food-heading"><h2 id="daily-food-title"><button type="button" class="food-title" :aria-expanded="opened" aria-controls="daily-food-content" @click="opened=!opened"><ToolEntryIcon name="文件" />日常饮食手册 <span aria-hidden="true">{{opened?'▾':'▸'}}</span></button></h2><div><span>8 类饮食知识</span><button type="button" :aria-expanded="opened" aria-controls="daily-food-content" @click="opened=!opened">{{opened?'收起 ▴':'展开 ▾'}}</button></div></header><div v-if="opened" id="daily-food-content"><p class="food-intro">面向一般健康成年人的日常搭配参考，不是每个人都要照量执行的食谱。儿童、孕哺期、老年人、食物过敏及需治疗饮食者，应采用相应人群指南或咨询医生／注册营养师。</p><p>重点是食物多样与长期均衡，不是某种“必吃食物”，也不是每天每种都吃齐。以下数量是类别总量，通常按生的可食部；干谷物、奶类和饮水另见卡片说明。</p><nav class="food-tabs" aria-label="饮食手册分类"><button type="button" :aria-pressed="tab==='foods'" @click="tab='foods'">每天吃些什么</button><button type="button" :aria-pressed="tab==='meals'" @click="tab='meals'">三餐搭配示例</button><button type="button" :aria-pressed="tab==='sources'" @click="tab='sources'">来源与适用说明</button></nav><template v-if="tab==='foods'"><input v-model="query" type="search" aria-label="搜索食物与饮食知识" placeholder="搜索 牛奶 / 豆腐 / 主食 / 水果" /><nav class="food-tabs" aria-label="食物类别"><button type="button" :aria-pressed="category===''" @click="category=''">全部类别</button><button v-for="g in groups" :key="g.id" type="button" :aria-pressed="category===g.id" @click="category=g.id">{{g.name}}</button></nav><p>{{filtered.length}} 类结果</p><div class="food-grid"><article v-for="g in filtered" :key="g.id" class="food-card"><h3><ToolEntryIcon :name="g.icon" />{{g.name}}</h3><p class="food-amount">{{g.amount}}</p><h4>有哪些可以选？</h4><ul><li v-for="item in g.examples" :key="item">{{item}}</li></ul><p>{{g.purpose}}</p><details><summary>重量口径与食用提示</summary><p>{{g.basis}}</p><p>{{g.tips}}</p></details><a :href="sources[g.source].url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">参考来源 ↗</a></article></div><p v-if="!filtered.length">没有匹配内容。<button type="button" @click="query='';category=''">清除筛选</button></p></template><div v-else-if="tab==='meals'" class="food-grid"><article v-for="meal in meals" :key="meal.name" class="food-card"><h3>{{meal.name}}</h3><p>{{meal.items}}</p><small>{{meal.note}}</small></article></div><section v-else aria-label="饮食来源与适用说明"><p>依据《中国居民膳食指南（2022）》一般人群建议及国家卫生健康委相关科普整理；内容核实日期：2026-10-31。参考量需结合活动量、能量需求、身体状态调整。</p><p>例举食物用于帮助选择，不表示同类食物之间按克数完全等价；也不据此诊断缺乏某种营养素或推荐补充剂。</p><ul><li v-for="source in sources" :key="source.url"><a :href="source.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{source.title}} ↗</a></li></ul></section></div></section></template>
<script>
import ToolEntryIcon from './ToolEntryIcon.vue';
import {foodGroups,foodSources,mealIdeas,filterFoodGroups} from '../data/daily-food.mjs';
export default {name:'DailyFoodHandbook',components:{ToolEntryIcon},data:()=>({opened:false,tab:'foods',query:'',category:'',groups:foodGroups,sources:foodSources,meals:mealIdeas}),computed:{filtered(){return filterFoodGroups(this.query,this.category);}}};
</script>
<style scoped>.daily-food{margin:32px 20px;padding:20px;font-size:13px;scroll-margin-top:80px;}.food-heading,.food-heading>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;}h2{margin:0;}.food-title{border:0!important;background:transparent!important;padding:0;text-align:left;font:inherit;}button,input{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--el-fill-color-blank);border:1px solid var(--el-border-color);padding:8px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;}button{cursor:pointer;}input{width:100%;}.food-tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:16px 0;}.food-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;}.food-card{min-width:0;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--el-border-color-light);background:var(--el-fill-color-blank);border-radius:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}h3{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 12px;}h4{font-size:13px;margin:14px 0 8px;}p,li{line-height:1.8;}p,small{color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);}.food-amount{color:var(--el-text-color-primary);background:var(--el-fill-color-light);padding:10px;border-radius:3px;}summary{cursor:pointer;}a{color:var(--ui-accent);display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;}ul{padding-left:20px;}.food-intro{border-left:3px solid var(--ui-accent);padding-left:12px;}@media(max-width:1100px){.food-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));}}@media(max-width:600px){.daily-food{margin:16px 12px;padding:14px;}.food-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);}}</style>
